  and .boundary.public_launch_claim == "does_not_replace_real_external_evidence"
  and .boundary.commit_claim == "does_not_commit_or_stage_files"
' "release review checkpoint manifest packet artifact exposes top-level working-tree/release-review count fields, binds them to nested grouped WIP slices and snapshots, and preserves read-only/no-public-launch boundary"
